    "### Observation\n",
    "## - SMOTE balanced the training dataset by generating synthetic samples for the minority class.\n",
    "## - Recall improved from **57.5%** to **63.4%**, indicating that the model identified more churn customers.\n",
    "## - However, Accuracy and Precision decreased because the model produced more false positive predictions.\n",
    "## - This demonstrates the trade-off between Precision and Recall when handling imbalanced datasets.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Conclusion:\n",
    "## SMOTE successfully improved minority class detection but reduced overall Accuracy and Precision. Depending on the business objective, this trade-off may be acceptable."
